  <item>
    <title>Vol.6 高原大镖客|高反、捡垃圾和数鸟的快乐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6683af10077b88831bacefa4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6683af10077b88831bacefa4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jul 2024 07:41:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期老皮夹克三位成员终于到齐，并且邀请了一位共同的朋友——小马（尕马）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>去年夏天，小马报名参与了一个环保项目，他走到西藏自治区，开始了为期一个月艰苦浪漫的“捡垃圾工作”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>西藏自治区是很多人的“彼岸”，而小马却给它增加了更多浪漫意象，不管是令人崩溃的高反、漂亮的星空、人们更亲密的关系、以及没有留底的合影，这些经历都足够让他自己难以忘怀。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>憧憬、北门、阿钟、小马</span></p><span></span><p><span>Songlist：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Raindrops Keep Fallin' on My Head——新爱乐交响乐团</span></p><span></span><p><span>Five hundred miles (Live)——山本润子</span></p><span></span><p><span>Space Oddity-David Bowie</span></p><span></span><p><span>The End of the World-Skeeter Davis</span></p><span></span><p><span>家——朱家明/荒井十一</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄影：小马（尕马）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loWwBXxemhFkJcoM0bWheGVY_n7F.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiTYbl1NKXzn4YyhmWbGcTYHpJrR.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmS__rAhu8ZTVt4nhpkPcdrRH0d-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FriDkGbRFRW7j8SYGlJS01NNxLqI.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjES5wgdMBneq5bT_Xnz469c0y35.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp_w_wRcccLl_ZWsohm2zpk730rR.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsmwX6Il6Fbra3gD73x9YFCTAN9B.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhALINK_jwNuO0oxbvshxJmlJV9l.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvpUbloXBSVTDj-YMw69ZHJy_Fy-.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
