  <item>
    <title>Vol.5 机车与旅行#01|去哪里不重要，在路上才重要</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664ee23ac59d1e5757219111</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664ee23ac59d1e5757219111</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 May 2024 06:29:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目，老皮夹克初创MC北门限时返场，还带来了一位好朋友——喜欢骑摩托车的小宝。</span></p><span></span><p><span>基于两位嘉宾“风象星座摩友”属性，这是一期预约了好久的节目，终于可以聊聊北门特别感兴趣的话题——摩托车与旅行。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对于小宝和北门而言，摩托车是交通工具，但也不只是交通工具，它是逃离钢筋水泥的契机，是见山看水的伙伴，也是脱离车水马龙的勇气。</span></p><span></span><p><span>水象星座浪漫感性家里蹲，风象星座勇敢豁达爱自由。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宝、北门、阿钟</span></p><span></span><p><span>Songlist：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Let's Dance-David Bowie</span></p><span></span><p><span>Come and Get Your Love-Redbone</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hello Dolly!-Jack Jezzro/The Beegie Adair Trio</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sunny Afternoon-The Kinks</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fle9R_FmrOJiJ4CRyY68Lf9E72LL.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoAA_uRpIDOaR113icCWo6HcZw2w.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk_ziqcGC5cBgLD9xpraZ8bCJ_up.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft63n45NXk0Ljh0h_0gF7s_AH3kj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsULVAPwu9OArUlQXSt9mbKs1MTr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llReTVq_u-peQiYXosb6sEznMx0X.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq-aCTWk-FwcSL_Z-sKyUy2_I6J3.m4a" length="95550820" type="audio/mp4"/>
